{"id":"968a4e5f16b2a94a","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/874_非结合_Lambek_演算_NL.md","title":"874 非结合 Lambek 演算 NL","display":"874_非结合_Lambek_演算_NL","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<h1 id=\"874-非结合-Lambek-演算-NL\">874 非结合 Lambek 演算 NL</h1>\n<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\mathsf{At}\\)</span> 为基本范畴集合。公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{ldiv},\\operatorname{rdiv}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{ldiv},\\operatorname{rdiv}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第 2 节定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 为这些构造子生成的最小闭包。其型别为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{ldiv},\\operatorname{rdiv}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{ldiv},\\operatorname{rdiv}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>非结合 Lambek 演算在后文使用未商去结合律的二叉树前件。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式与替换\">2. 公式与替换</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{rdiv}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{rdiv}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{prod}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{prod}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{rdiv}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{rdiv}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[\\sigma]\">\\(A[\\sigma]\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}(p)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{prod}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{prod}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{ldiv}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{ldiv}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rdiv}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{rdiv}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{rdiv}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{rdiv}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:X\\text{ 有限}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:X\\text{ 有限}\\}\\)</span>。定义绑定原子函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>固定新鲜原子选择函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(X)\\notin X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(X)\\notin X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对任一原子重命名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{NL}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{NL}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由于没有绑定名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{NL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{NL}}\\)</span> 均是捕获避免替换。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{NL}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{NL}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-结构树与洞上下文\">3. 结构树与洞上下文</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tree}\">\\(\\mathsf{Tree}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Hole}\">\\(\\mathsf{Hole}\\)</span> 分别是以下闭包条件生成的最小集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\langle A\\rangle\\in\\mathsf{Tree},\\qquad\nX,Y\\in\\mathsf{Tree}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{node}(X,Y)\\in\\mathsf{Tree},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\langle A\\rangle\\in\\mathsf{Tree},\\qquad\nX,Y\\in\\mathsf{Tree}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{node}(X,Y)\\in\\mathsf{Tree},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Box\\in\\mathsf{Hole},\\qquad\nH\\in\\mathsf{Hole},X\\in\\mathsf{Tree}\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{node}(H,X),\\operatorname{node}(X,H)\\in\\mathsf{Hole}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Box\\in\\mathsf{Hole},\\qquad\nH\\in\\mathsf{Hole},X\\in\\mathsf{Tree}\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{node}(H,X),\\operatorname{node}(X,H)\\in\\mathsf{Hole}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>两类结构都取原始构造树相等，不商去结合或交换。填洞函数\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}:\\mathsf{Hole}\\times\\mathsf{Tree}\\to\\mathsf{Tree}\">\\(\\operatorname{plug}:\\mathsf{Hole}\\times\\mathsf{Tree}\\to\\mathsf{Tree}\\)</span> 由下列三个递归子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}(\\Box,X)=X,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}(\\Box,X)=X,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}(\\operatorname{node}(H,Y),X)=\\operatorname{node}(\\operatorname{plug}(H,X),Y),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}(\\operatorname{node}(H,Y),X)=\\operatorname{node}(\\operatorname{plug}(H,X),Y),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}(\\operatorname{node}(Y,H),X)=\\operatorname{node}(Y,\\operatorname{plug}(H,X)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}(\\operatorname{node}(Y,H),X)=\\operatorname{node}(Y,\\operatorname{plug}(H,X)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>序列集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}=\\{X\\Rightarrow A:X\\in\\mathsf{Tree},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Seq}=\\{X\\Rightarrow A:X\\in\\mathsf{Tree},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-公理\">4. 公理</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{NL}}=\\{\\langle A\\rangle\\Rightarrow A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{NL}}=\\{\\langle A\\rangle\\Rightarrow A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-规则关系\">5. 规则关系</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}^{&lt;\\omega}\n=\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Seq}^n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Seq}^{&lt;\\omega}\n=\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Seq}^n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以下每个规则族均是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Seq}\">\\(\\mathsf{Seq}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Seq}\\)</span> 的子集。</p>\n<p>约定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Q_0,\\ldots,Q_{n-1};Q):=((Q_0,\\ldots,Q_{n-1}),Q)\">\\((Q_0,\\ldots,Q_{n-1};Q):=((Q_0,\\ldots,Q_{n-1}),Q)\\)</span>，并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(();Q):=((),Q)\">\\((();Q):=((),Q)\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\cdot R}=\\{((X\\Rightarrow A),(Y\\Rightarrow B);\\operatorname{node}(X,Y)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)):X,Y\\in\\mathsf{Tree},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\cdot R}=\\{((X\\Rightarrow A),(Y\\Rightarrow B);\\operatorname{node}(X,Y)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)):X,Y\\in\\mathsf{Tree},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\cdot L}=\\{((\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\operatorname{node}(\\langle A\\rangle,\\langle B\\rangle))\\Rightarrow C);\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)\\rangle)\\Rightarrow C):H\\in\\mathsf{Hole},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\cdot L}=\\{((\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\operatorname{node}(\\langle A\\rangle,\\langle B\\rangle))\\Rightarrow C);\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)\\rangle)\\Rightarrow C):H\\in\\mathsf{Hole},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash R}=\\{((\\operatorname{node}(\\langle A\\rangle,X)\\Rightarrow B);X\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)):X\\in\\mathsf{Tree},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash R}=\\{((\\operatorname{node}(\\langle A\\rangle,X)\\Rightarrow B);X\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)):X\\in\\mathsf{Tree},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash L}=\\{((X\\Rightarrow A),(\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle B\\rangle)\\Rightarrow C);\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\operatorname{node}(X,\\langle\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)\\rangle))\\Rightarrow C):H\\in\\mathsf{Hole},X\\in\\mathsf{Tree},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash L}=\\{((X\\Rightarrow A),(\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle B\\rangle)\\Rightarrow C);\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\operatorname{node}(X,\\langle\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)\\rangle))\\Rightarrow C):H\\in\\mathsf{Hole},X\\in\\mathsf{Tree},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{/R}=\\{((\\operatorname{node}(X,\\langle A\\rangle)\\Rightarrow B);X\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{rdiv}(B,A)):X\\in\\mathsf{Tree},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{/R}=\\{((\\operatorname{node}(X,\\langle A\\rangle)\\Rightarrow B);X\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{rdiv}(B,A)):X\\in\\mathsf{Tree},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{/L}=\\{((X\\Rightarrow A),(\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle B\\rangle)\\Rightarrow C);\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\operatorname{node}(\\langle\\operatorname{rdiv}(B,A)\\rangle,X))\\Rightarrow C):H\\in\\mathsf{Hole},X\\in\\mathsf{Tree},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{/L}=\\{((X\\Rightarrow A),(\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle B\\rangle)\\Rightarrow C);\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\operatorname{node}(\\langle\\operatorname{rdiv}(B,A)\\rangle,X))\\Rightarrow C):H\\in\\mathsf{Hole},X\\in\\mathsf{Tree},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ass}}=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ass}}=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}=\\{((X\\Rightarrow A),(\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle A\\rangle)\\Rightarrow B);\\operatorname{plug}(H,X)\\Rightarrow B):H\\in\\mathsf{Hole},X\\in\\mathsf{Tree},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}=\\{((X\\Rightarrow A),(\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle A\\rangle)\\Rightarrow B);\\operatorname{plug}(H,X)\\Rightarrow B):H\\in\\mathsf{Hole},X\\in\\mathsf{Tree},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{NL}}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\cdot R}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\cdot L}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash R}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash L}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{/R}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{/L}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ass}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{NL}}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\cdot R}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\cdot L}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash R}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash L}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{/R}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{/L}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ass}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明树\">6. 证明树</h1>\n<p>有限有根有序树是四元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\">\\((T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 有限非空，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in T\">\\(r\\in T\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 无父节点，其余节点有唯一父节点；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec\">\\(\\prec\\)</span> 无环且每个节点沿父关系有限步到达 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ch}(u)\">\\(\\operatorname{ch}(u)\\)</span> 无重复地有限列举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 的全部直接子节点。</p>\n<p>这里仅对上述证明树四元组明确型别：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\prec\\ \\subseteq T\\times T,\\qquad\\operatorname{ch}:T\\to T^{&lt;\\omega}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\prec\\ \\subseteq T\\times T,\\qquad\\operatorname{ch}:T\\to T^{&lt;\\omega}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\prec u\">\\(v\\prec u\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 的直接子节点，即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 是其父节点。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in T\">\\(u\\in T\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n_u=|\\operatorname{ch}(u)|\">\\(n_u=|\\operatorname{ch}(u)|\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{ch}(u))=\\{v\\in T:v\\prec u\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{ch}(u))=\\{v\\in T:v\\prec u\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall i,j&lt;n_u\\,\\bigl(\\operatorname{ch}(u)(i)=\\operatorname{ch}(u)(j)\\Longrightarrow i=j\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall i,j&lt;n_u\\,\\bigl(\\operatorname{ch}(u)(i)=\\operatorname{ch}(u)(j)\\Longrightarrow i=j\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对集合参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi,Q\">\\(\\pi,Q\\)</span> 定义证明检查谓词：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{NL}}(\\pi,Q)\n\\Longleftrightarrow Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}\\land\n\\exists T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell\\;\n\\left[\\begin{array}{l}\n\\pi=(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\\land\n(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\\text{ 满足本节的全部有限有根有序树条件}\\\\\n{}\\land\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Seq}\\land\\ell(r)=Q\\\\\n{}\\land\\forall u\\in T\\;\n\\left((\\operatorname{ch}(u)=()\\land\\ell(u)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{NL}})\n\\lor(\\operatorname{ch}(u)\\ne()\\land(\\ell\\circ\\operatorname{ch}(u),\\ell(u))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{NL}})\\right)\n\\end{array}\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{NL}}(\\pi,Q)\n\\Longleftrightarrow Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}\\land\n\\exists T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell\\;\n\\left[\\begin{array}{l}\n\\pi=(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\\land\n(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\\text{ 满足本节的全部有限有根有序树条件}\\\\\n{}\\land\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Seq}\\land\\ell(r)=Q\\\\\n{}\\land\\forall u\\in T\\;\n\\left((\\operatorname{ch}(u)=()\\land\\ell(u)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{NL}})\n\\lor(\\operatorname{ch}(u)\\ne()\\land(\\ell\\circ\\operatorname{ch}(u),\\ell(u))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{NL}})\\right)\n\\end{array}\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\\circ\\operatorname{ch}(u)\">\\(\\ell\\circ\\operatorname{ch}(u)\\)</span> 为有序子标号列。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathsf{Tree}\">\\(X\\in\\mathsf{Tree}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 定义证明纤维类：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{NL}}(X,A)=\\{\\pi:\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{NL}}(\\pi,X\\Rightarrow A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{NL}}(X,A)=\\{\\pi:\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{NL}}(\\pi,X\\Rightarrow A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本节及下节的证明纤维按参数展开为可定义类，成员断言缩写右侧谓词；不声明所有任意节点重标号的全体为集合，不对该类取幂集。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-可导性\">7. 可导性</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X\\vdash_{\\mathsf{NL}}A\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\pi\\;\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{NL}}(\\pi,X\\Rightarrow A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X\\vdash_{\\mathsf{NL}}A\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\pi\\;\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{NL}}(\\pi,X\\Rightarrow A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义可导相继式集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{NL}}\n=\n\\{X\\Rightarrow A\\in\\mathsf{Seq}:X\\vdash_{\\mathsf{NL}}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{NL}}\n=\n\\{X\\Rightarrow A\\in\\mathsf{Seq}:X\\vdash_{\\mathsf{NL}}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}\">\\(Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathsf{Tree}\">\\(X\\in\\mathsf{Tree}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 定义证明类与证书类：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{NL}}(Q)=\\{\\pi:\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{NL}}(\\pi,Q)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{NL}}(Q)=\\{\\pi:\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{NL}}(\\pi,Q)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{NL}}(X,A)=\\{\\pi:\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{NL}}(\\pi,X\\Rightarrow A)\\}\n=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{NL}}(X,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{NL}}(X,A)=\\{\\pi:\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{NL}}(\\pi,X\\Rightarrow A)\\}\n=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{NL}}(X,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这些类只索引当地有限证明树，不引入语义载体或外延满足关系。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-目标差异\">8. 目标差异</h1>\n<p>本条目的目标差异是：前件保留未取结合商的二叉结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tree}\">\\(\\mathsf{Tree}\\)</span>，结构替换只由一洞语境 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Hole}\">\\(\\mathsf{Hole}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}\">\\(\\operatorname{plug}\\)</span> 给出，并且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ass}}=\\varnothing\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ass}}=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>非结合 Lambek 演算的系统差异对象：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{NL}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Tree},\n\\mathsf{Hole},\n\\operatorname{plug},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ass}}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{NL}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Tree},\n\\mathsf{Hole},\n\\operatorname{plug},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ass}}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-整个形式系统\">9. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>以下是元层规格包；证明纤维按本地谓词模式展开，不是将真类作为集合元素的元组。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{NL}}=(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Frm},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{NL}},\\operatorname{Sub},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{NL}},\\mathsf{Tree},\\mathsf{Hole},\\operatorname{plug},\\mathsf{Seq},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{NL}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ass}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{NL}},\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{NL}},\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{NL}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{NL}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{NL}},\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{NL}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{NL}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{NL}}=(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Frm},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{NL}},\\operatorname{Sub},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{NL}},\\mathsf{Tree},\\mathsf{Hole},\\operatorname{plug},\\mathsf{Seq},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{NL}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ass}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{NL}},\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{NL}},\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{NL}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{NL}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{NL}},\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{NL}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{NL}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只定义非结合二叉结构上的 Lambek 证明关系；不含结合、交换、弱化、收缩或语义满足关系。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"874-非结合-Lambek-演算-NL","text":"874 非结合 Lambek 演算 NL","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式与替换","text":"2. 公式与替换","level":1},{"id":"3.-结构树与洞上下文","text":"3. 结构树与洞上下文","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理","text":"4. 公理","level":1},{"id":"5.-规则关系","text":"5. 规则关系","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明树","text":"6. 证明树","level":1},{"id":"7.-可导性","text":"7. 可导性","level":1},{"id":"8.-目标差异","text":"8. 目标差异","level":1},{"id":"9.-整个形式系统","text":"9. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{At}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{ldiv},\\operatorname{rdiv}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{ldiv},\\operatorname{rdiv}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},","display":true},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},","display":true},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},","display":true},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{rdiv}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{prod}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{rdiv}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}","display":true},{"tex":"A[\\sigma]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}(p)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(p),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{prod}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{ldiv}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rdiv}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{rdiv}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:X\\text{ 有限